  "appSelfChecks": "HW6 self-checks — pass 21, fail 0, pending 0 (of 21)\nbackend: webgl\nMF reference: factors 16, checkpoint epoch 4, val RMSE 0.9779\n\nPASS  reference graph: uniform alpha=0.85 matches readme 4.1 values — C>A>B>D; produced by student pageRank(alpha, {transition: REFERENCE_GRAPH.transition}), iterations 28\nPASS  reference graph: restart at A alpha=0.85 matches readme 4.1 values — A>C>B>D (D stays 0); produced by student personalizedPageRank(seedNode, alpha, {transition: REFERENCE_GRAPH.transition})\nPASS  row normalization: every nonzero-degree row sums to 1 — 6 positive-degree row(s) sum to 1; 2 dangling row(s) are zero\nPASS  restart distributions: nonnegative and summing to 1 — uniform + one-hot over 4 nodes\nPASS  iterations preserve total probability (sum approx 1) — sum = 1.0000000596 over 3 synthetic nodes (graph.js)\nPASS  stationary scores are nonnegative — 3 scores nonnegative (graph.js)\nPASS  one extra update produces approximately the same distribution — L1 = 8.017e-7\nPASS  zero-degree node fixture preserves probability mass — danglingMask [false,true,false,false,true]; mass 0.99999997 / 1.00000000\nPASS  matrix orientation: probability collects at the pointed-to node, not the source — p = [0.486487, 0.256757, 0.256757]\nPASS  three outgoing links: each gets probability 1/3 — three movie links receive 1/3 each; their sole return link receives 1\nPASS  PPR: mapped user restart, alpha=0 and isolated-user mass — user 42 maps to node 1; an isolated seed retains all mass; alpha=0 uses only restart\nPASS  iteration cap: report nonconvergence unless tolerance was met — capped alpha=0.85 is not converged; alpha=0 is already stationary\nPASS  repeated PageRank/PPR runs: no retained tensors — live tensors before/after six runs: 2/2\nPASS  recommendTopK: excludes previously rated movies and breaks ties by ascending id — 10 eligible items for user 1\nPASS  movieScores: returns movie probabilities in mapping order — user nodes excluded; explicit